PTX TMA-load+stale-source
"P0 writes the source g with a generic store and then copies it without a proxy fence: the async-proxy read may see the old value (8.6, 18759). Expected: allowed."
{
g=5;
d=0 @cta 0;
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
P0:r0=0;
P0:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                  ;
 st.weak.global g, 6                                                       ;
 mbarrier.arrive.expect_tx.release.cta b, 1                                ;
 cp.async.bulk.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, b ;
 mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, b, 0                            ;
 ld.weak.shared::cta r1, d                                                 ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 1 /\ P0:r1 == 5)
